{"id":"1e78c5a12fb8a38b","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-semisimple.md","title":"Semisimple","display":"df-semisimple — Semisimple","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-semisimple","aliases":["93-df-semisimple"],"display":"df-semisimple — Semisimple","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-semisimple"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-semisimple</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semisimple — Semisimple"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span> is an algebra candidate, with diagonal and universal congruences <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\">\\(\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\)</span> whenever it is an algebra.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> (congruence lattice, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span> (set of maximal proper congruences defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SSim}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SSim}_{93}\\)</span> (semisimplicity predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple}\\vdash\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\mu\\neq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;(\\mu\\subseteq\\theta\\subsetneq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\to\\theta=\\mu)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple}\\vdash\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\mu\\neq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;(\\mu\\subseteq\\theta\\subsetneq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\to\\theta=\\mu)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple}\\vdash \\mathrm{SSim}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(a\\neq b\\to\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\notin\\mu)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple}\\vdash \\mathrm{SSim}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(a\\neq b\\to\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\notin\\mu)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The separation form is equivalent to intersection of all maximal proper congruences being diagonal, but it remains well-typed even when that family is empty.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}$ is the algebra predicate of [[93-df-algebra]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)$ (congruence lattice, see [[93-df-congruence]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{\\mathbf A},\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SSim}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple}\\vdash\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\mu\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A):\\mu\\neq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;(\\mu\\subseteq\\theta\\subsetneq\\nabla_{\\mathbf A}\\to\\theta=\\mu)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semisimple}\\vdash \\mathrm{SSim}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall a,b\\in|\\mathbf A|\\;\\bigl(a\\neq b\\to\\exists\\mu\\in\\mathrm{MaxCon}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\notin\\mu)\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1469,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["30b341bfbd8b5301","6730349967b8ffce"]}